DR3 vs DDR4 vs DDR5 RAM

FEATURE        | DDR3                  | DDR4                  | DDR5
---------------+-----------------------+-----------------------+----------------------
Speed          | 800-2133 MT/s         | 1600-3200 MT/s         | 4800-8400+ MT/s

Voltage        | ~1.5V                 | ~1.2V                 | ~1.1V

Performance    | Basic                 | Faster                | Much faster

Power          | Low efficiency        | Better efficiency     | Best efficiency

Typical Use    | Older PCs/laptops     | Modern PCs/laptops    | Newer high-end PCs


